    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFOR SALE BY PRIVATE TREATY\n\nIMPRESSIVE DETACHED RESIDENCE\n\nA beautifully outfitted and presented four-bedroom detached residence situated in this popular private estate off the Kingscourt road, 400m from Carrickmacross town centre.\n\n \n\nHall- Wooden floor\n\nSitting room - 4.1m x 5.2m - Gas fireplace , wooden floor\n\nKitchen / Dining room - 6.5m x 5.2m - tiled , integrated appliance , Bosch washing machine , beko dishwasher , hot point oven and electric hob\n\nWC - 1.9m x 1.7m - tiled\n\n1st floor\n\nBed 1 - 3.7m x 4.6m - wooden floor ,built in wardrobes\n\nEn suite - 3m x 1.2m - tiled , Triton electric shower\n\nBed 2 - 3.8m x 3.2m - wooden floor , built in wardrobe\n\nBed 3 - 2.8m x2.8m - wooden floor\n\nBed 4 - 3m x 2.8 m - wooden floor\n\nMain bathroom - 2m x 2m - tiled , electric shower and bath\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Mains Services \nGas Fired \nEnclosed back garden, side entrance\nWooden shed\nShort walk to town and all amenities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Carrickmacross take the Kingscourt Road R179 for 400m, Woodvale is the second development on the left hand side, No.8 is in the first cul de sac on the right hand side."
      }
